    "turn_text": "Both a celebration, a remembrance, it had all emotion, right? They were happy, they were sad, they were devastated, but they remembered their beautiful boy, right? Yes, their beautiful boy, and we're not going to forget, we're going to find out what happened, we're going to do that within the first week, and you have my word. Okay, thank you, President Trump.",
