 supply. Again, preparewithJoe.com. The food kit lasts up to 25 years in storage. We've got several of these now. It's going to offer over 2,000 calories a day every single day. Again, preparewithJoe.com. Get your three-month emergency food kit from my Patreon supply. Again, preparewithJoe.com is the website. You'll be glad you did. We're back after this. Stay here.",
