    "turn_text": "Okay, appreciate talking to you again. We talked a while back when you were actually going for the seat. I'm glad that you're the guy who's there now. We want to talk about what's going on in Aurora because if the news media had us, you know, had its ability to tell us what's going on. There's nothing going on. Nobody's taking over anything. Not a big deal. The mayor says, no, I'd say they're just making it up. The governor's saying, yeah, they're just making it up. What I noticed though, Greg, is that none of these media types are packing up their gear and going to Aurora. Nobody's going there. We've all seen the Blink camera footage now that there are armed gang members going through, knocking on doors, taking over vacant apartment complexes. And the fact that the media wants us to believe Don't believe your eyes, believe what we say, really bothers me. I want to give you a back and forth between Martha Raditz and JD Vance, the nominee, the Republican nomination for Vice President. I want your thoughts on this. I know that you hadn't seen it before today.",
