    "turn_idx": 82,
    "turn_text": "Look, not only do we have video, we also have a report from a law firm that was hired by the financial underwriter of these apartment complex that they gave to the mayor. They gave to the Aurora City Mayor and the government and showed them exactly what they discovered during investigation. So not only do you have video, you have a report from a law firm and you have incidents being reported from the police officers and others and they still are in denial. It's just crazy. Look, it's clear to me that they're so concerned about what the criminal activity that's coming to America because of the open border. Look, the prison gang from Venezuela is definitely in Colorado. It's definitely in Aurora. It is expanding. And this is a group of individuals that care less. about law and order. They could care less about our police officers. They're here to not only continue their criminal activity, but to expand it. Look, I got it from some very good sources when I was down at the border. But the Venezuelan gangs have decided that Colorado, specifically Denver, is going to be one of their headquarters to establish themselves in the United States. Even the Mexican mafia has already cleared war on them because they're interfering with their operations. And this was an article that was written in Washington Times. So it is real and for them to deny it. It's just unbelievable.",
