    "turn_text": "I really like that there's a sponsor involved because if there is, now there's somebody who's an American citizen who's on the hook to make sure this person is here doing the right thing and doing it by the law. It is a U.S. Representative Greg Lopez. Let me ask you about FEMA lying in its face off and Green Jump here lying her face off and Biden and Harris lying about the funds that have been used. We know that in fiscal year 23, and fiscal year 24 combined $1.14 billion with spent on the emergency needs of people coming here illegally. They're lying about it. They're saying that it didn't happen. In fact, the Korean John Pierre the other day said that Donald Trump did it, which is not true. We know that my orcas is lying. First, he says he's out of funds, then he says he has enough funds, and then Congress gives them $20 billion more dollars. Greg, can you in a very simple way, got some kind of a dumb guy? Can you make me understand exactly how FEMA funding is working and what should we believe?",
